WEBVTT

01:36.610 --> 01:39.940
[NORTHWARD]

01:40.100 --> 01:41.930
[Episode 37]

01:42.090 --> 01:44.360
[Emergency]

01:47.789 --> 01:48.310
Where is he?

01:49.400 --> 01:50.170
In critical care.

01:53.970 --> 01:54.970
Come here.

01:55.060 --> 01:56.610
Sit down. Don't panic.

01:56.640 --> 01:57.250
Okay.

01:59.890 --> 02:06.500
[Department of Critical Medicine]

02:04.850 --> 02:06.670
Why were you with him?

02:06.950 --> 02:08.800
I ran into him in front of the restaurant.

02:08.820 --> 02:11.180
I thought I'd make him some noodles.

02:12.840 --> 02:14.660
Which of you is the patient's family?

02:14.690 --> 02:15.840
-Me.
-I am.

02:16.600 --> 02:17.940
The patient is crashing.

02:17.970 --> 02:19.930
You need to brace yourselves for the worst.

02:20.410 --> 02:22.410
It's time you sent someone on your behalf to say goodbye to him.

02:30.570 --> 02:31.980
Let Xingchi do it.

02:34.480 --> 02:35.430
Don't ask.

02:35.470 --> 02:37.030
Just get in there.

02:37.240 --> 02:38.570
Who is Liu Yuling?

02:39.440 --> 02:40.360
I am.

02:40.470 --> 02:41.120
The patient wants to see you.

02:41.120 --> 02:41.870
Come with me.

02:47.540 --> 02:48.510
Go ahead.

02:48.930 --> 02:50.600
Xingchi and I will be waiting here.

03:34.790 --> 03:36.030
Yuling...

03:38.690 --> 03:39.360
It's me.

03:41.060 --> 03:42.290
It's me, Mo.

03:43.430 --> 03:44.310
I'm here.

03:45.360 --> 03:46.540
I'm here.

04:04.020 --> 04:05.420
I'm sorry.

04:09.920 --> 04:11.350
Before I left,

04:16.410 --> 04:17.459
I just want to see

04:19.209 --> 04:21.880
you and our son for one last time.

04:23.870 --> 04:26.500
I know. I know.

04:27.210 --> 04:28.090
In my pocket,

04:29.660 --> 04:31.370
there is a bank card.

04:35.890 --> 04:37.040
The password

04:39.400 --> 04:41.230
is Xingchi's birthday.

04:42.940 --> 04:44.320
Give it to him.

04:48.310 --> 04:49.409
Don't worry.

04:51.210 --> 04:52.060
Consider it done.

04:54.300 --> 04:55.650
Yuling,

04:58.090 --> 04:59.920
I'm sorry

05:03.690 --> 05:06.340
for all you've been through.

05:19.180 --> 05:19.830
Mo.

05:21.160 --> 05:22.210
Mo?

05:28.780 --> 05:30.280
Doctor! Doctor!

05:30.310 --> 05:31.400
Help! Help!

05:32.040 --> 05:33.840
Mo! Mo!

05:33.930 --> 05:36.250
Hang in there! You hang in there!

05:50.720 --> 05:53.220
[Department of Critical Medicine]

05:52.140 --> 05:52.830
She's out.

06:07.540 --> 06:08.660
How did it go?

06:15.910 --> 06:16.800
He passed away?

06:24.530 --> 06:25.520
Well,

06:27.130 --> 06:28.620
did he leave any last words?

06:34.570 --> 06:37.120
It's high time you said it all out!

06:57.390 --> 06:59.550
Mo wanted you to have this bank card.

07:00.360 --> 07:02.810
All his savings are in it.

07:05.910 --> 07:07.010
He wanted me to have it?

07:13.090 --> 07:14.690
The password is your birthday.

07:23.440 --> 07:25.170
You will make

07:27.510 --> 07:28.710
his after-death arrangements.

07:36.510 --> 07:37.600
I'll be having a cigarette outside.

07:39.420 --> 07:41.150
You should tell Xingchi the truth.

07:55.470 --> 07:56.080
Mom,

07:56.750 --> 07:58.090
what is this all about?

08:09.010 --> 08:10.510
Tell me, please!

08:10.640 --> 08:12.410
What's your relationship with Mo?

08:13.050 --> 08:13.870
Don't hide the truth from me.

08:13.870 --> 08:14.800
Spill it. I can take it.

08:14.800 --> 08:15.870
Please tell me.

08:18.420 --> 08:19.340
Xingchi,

08:27.410 --> 08:29.420
Mo was your biological father.

08:41.270 --> 08:41.840
Come here.

08:43.640 --> 08:44.670
Sit down.

08:45.700 --> 08:46.730
I'll tell you everything.

09:04.300 --> 09:05.670
Mo and I

09:07.770 --> 09:09.130
grew up together.

09:12.910 --> 09:14.200
We were childhood sweethearts.

09:16.140 --> 09:18.150
However, my family considered him poor,

09:20.050 --> 09:22.370
and firmly opposed us being together.

09:23.930 --> 09:24.960
Even so, neither Mo nor I

09:24.960 --> 09:26.440
wanted to break up.

09:29.280 --> 09:30.040
Therefore,

09:33.310 --> 09:35.060
we eloped.

09:40.270 --> 09:41.700
That decision

09:47.050 --> 09:49.420
completely changed our lives.

09:51.620 --> 09:52.720
Later,

09:54.430 --> 09:56.120
my family found us.

09:57.480 --> 09:59.230
They insisted on taking me home.

10:04.060 --> 10:05.230
But at that time...

10:09.800 --> 10:12.510
I was already pregnant with you.

10:15.660 --> 10:17.140
How could I leave?

10:26.650 --> 10:28.880
Mo had a fight with my family.

10:31.360 --> 10:32.720
In order to protect me and you,

10:34.920 --> 10:35.930
he wrestled with my cousin,

10:38.600 --> 10:40.660
and accidentally caused him to paralyze.

10:47.290 --> 10:48.990
Mo was then put behind bars

10:50.420 --> 10:52.200
for aggravated assault.

10:53.050 --> 10:55.310
I was brought home by my family.

11:00.570 --> 11:02.500
They tried to force me to have an abortion.

11:07.780 --> 11:08.620
But I...

11:09.680 --> 11:11.890
I couldn't bring myself to do it, son.

11:18.500 --> 11:21.190
I ran away from home in desperation.

11:21.440 --> 11:22.120
I kept running...

11:23.530 --> 11:25.620
till I reached the canal.

11:25.840 --> 11:27.870
I looked at the river and thought

11:27.870 --> 11:30.270
maybe I should drown myself.

11:30.320 --> 11:31.360
If I died,

11:32.840 --> 11:33.390
then...

11:34.870 --> 11:37.480
nobody could take you away from me.

11:41.870 --> 11:42.480
That day,

11:43.870 --> 11:45.870
the water was so cold.

11:53.000 --> 11:54.020
When I thought

11:55.630 --> 11:57.920
I was about to die,

11:59.760 --> 12:01.190
I met your father

12:02.710 --> 12:05.330
who was visiting the canal for information.

12:12.120 --> 12:14.010
He saved my life.

12:15.970 --> 12:18.720
He raised you like his own son.

12:22.930 --> 12:24.530
He also gave us a home.

12:25.600 --> 12:26.630
Xingchi.

12:27.360 --> 12:28.200
Xingchi,

12:28.600 --> 12:29.840
this is all my fault.

12:31.220 --> 12:32.150
Your dad

12:32.570 --> 12:34.530
and you shouldn't be the ones

12:34.600 --> 12:36.030
to take the consequences.

12:37.370 --> 12:38.440
Over these years,

12:41.110 --> 12:42.440
I've always loved your dad,

12:43.670 --> 12:45.100
and respected him.

12:46.280 --> 12:47.550
He is a good man.

12:49.120 --> 12:50.550
But the more I love him,

12:51.420 --> 12:52.420
and the more I respect him,

12:57.660 --> 12:59.910
the more I feel guilty about him.

13:41.330 --> 13:42.210
You're back.

13:58.960 --> 14:00.630
Your mom told you the truth, didn't she?

14:11.150 --> 14:12.150
We didn't mean to hide it from you.

14:14.690 --> 14:16.140
We planned to

14:16.370 --> 14:18.130
tell you when you grew up,

14:20.120 --> 14:22.360
but we kept stalling till now.

14:26.850 --> 14:27.830
I'll leave.

14:30.440 --> 14:34.150
I won't be an annoying old man.

14:52.450 --> 14:54.330
My mom and I couldn't have survived without you.

14:58.530 --> 15:00.800
You gave up your career for me.

15:03.490 --> 15:04.660
So we owe you a lot.

15:06.660 --> 15:07.780
You don't owe me anything.

15:11.690 --> 15:12.650
I did everything voluntarily.

15:21.500 --> 15:22.350
Xingchi,

15:27.230 --> 15:28.770
now that you've grown up,

15:32.900 --> 15:35.140
I wouldn't see you as a child anymore.

15:37.630 --> 15:38.750
Tonight,

15:41.540 --> 15:42.640
let's talk

15:44.650 --> 15:45.990
to each other

15:48.480 --> 15:49.390
as two adult men.

16:00.440 --> 16:02.010
I've never regretted my decision.

16:05.550 --> 16:06.630
At first,

16:08.480 --> 16:09.870
I thought I was doing

16:09.890 --> 16:11.170
a very noble thing.

16:13.510 --> 16:14.390
Of course,

16:14.720 --> 16:15.870
I didn't do this stuff

16:15.870 --> 16:17.200
because I'm a noble man.

16:18.630 --> 16:19.850
I love your mom,

16:21.190 --> 16:22.090
and I love you too.

16:27.690 --> 16:29.160
My mistake was

16:29.220 --> 16:30.980
not being a good enough father.

16:33.490 --> 16:34.390
Sometimes,

16:34.390 --> 16:36.360
I couldn't control my emotions.

16:38.580 --> 16:40.030
Do you know what I'm saying?

16:51.630 --> 16:54.470
You didn't go to college because you hated me.

16:56.930 --> 16:58.960
In fact, you could've gone to a good college

16:58.960 --> 17:00.550
just like any other kid

17:00.730 --> 17:02.080
in the courtyard,

17:02.080 --> 17:03.960
had a good job,

17:05.869 --> 17:07.859
and led a decent life.

17:11.980 --> 17:13.329
I don't regret

17:14.579 --> 17:16.020
everything I've done,

17:16.819 --> 17:18.410
except for that one.

17:22.050 --> 17:24.119
I held you back, son.

17:30.030 --> 17:32.210
I'm sorry.

17:32.830 --> 17:34.000
I also owe your mom an apology.

17:34.000 --> 17:35.680
Let me finish.

17:39.700 --> 17:41.610
Whenever I think about this,

17:44.350 --> 17:45.750
the heavy weight of guilt

17:45.750 --> 17:47.830
inside me

17:49.130 --> 17:50.750
makes me feel suffocated.

17:50.780 --> 17:51.670
For real, son,

17:54.240 --> 17:55.400
I was wrong.

18:31.210 --> 18:33.210
You gave me and my mom a chance to live a new life.

18:36.990 --> 18:37.560
Dad,

18:46.330 --> 18:48.020
let's put the past behind us.

18:51.570 --> 18:53.160
I want you to know

18:53.160 --> 18:54.750
that you're a very successful man.

18:57.560 --> 18:59.640
You have a wife who loves you dearly,

19:01.590 --> 19:03.090
and a son

19:04.460 --> 19:06.360
who would like to take care of you when you get old.

19:10.610 --> 19:11.170
Dad,

19:13.890 --> 19:15.630
I hope you can stop

19:16.920 --> 19:18.440
burying everything

19:20.800 --> 19:22.680
deep down in your heart.

19:27.690 --> 19:29.110
You can confide in me.

19:30.230 --> 19:31.510
I also hope

19:33.430 --> 19:34.640
that from now on,

19:37.140 --> 19:38.970
you will start learning

19:40.070 --> 19:41.790
how to be a good husband

19:44.200 --> 19:45.240
and a good father.

19:52.970 --> 19:54.060
Little brat.

20:00.730 --> 20:01.860
I got it.

20:03.710 --> 20:04.770
I'll try my best.

20:29.730 --> 20:30.730
[For donation]

20:30.760 --> 20:31.900
[For postage]

20:31.900 --> 20:36.380
[For keeping]

20:39.890 --> 20:47.420
[For keeping]

21:07.890 --> 21:13.700
[It's a boy. He weighs 3.75 kilograms. His name is Shao Xingchi.]
[I wish you all the best. Don't worry about us.]

21:16.200 --> 21:16.640
Wait for me!

21:16.640 --> 21:17.160
Stop running!

21:21.590 --> 21:24.200
Watch out! Be careful!

21:25.630 --> 21:26.460
It's fine.

21:27.980 --> 21:29.030
You two...

21:29.060 --> 21:30.090
Sorry!

21:30.230 --> 21:32.010
You'll suffer if I catch you!

21:37.200 --> 21:37.790
Shoes.

21:53.150 --> 21:54.810
You give me the same kind of shoes every year.

21:54.830 --> 21:56.520
Can't you buy me another gift?

21:56.540 --> 21:59.010
Cut the crap. You should be glad to have these.

21:59.030 --> 21:59.900
I won't wear them.

22:00.180 --> 22:01.380
Look at the shoes.

22:01.420 --> 22:03.350
Those who don't know better would think I'm moving to a rural area.

22:04.040 --> 22:05.010
Don't talk nonsense.

22:05.760 --> 22:07.360
See, these shoes are exquisite.

22:07.380 --> 22:08.660
They're made by hands.

22:08.680 --> 22:10.140
Shoes of this kind are expansive abroad.

22:10.240 --> 22:12.050
Put them on. See if they fit.

22:12.330 --> 22:14.410
Didn't you love leather shoes when you were little?

22:15.720 --> 22:16.580
I won't wear them.

22:17.000 --> 22:19.130
Wanghe will laugh at me if he sees these on me.

22:22.530 --> 22:23.840
Try them on now.

22:25.640 --> 22:27.690
Can't I wear other shoes?

22:29.160 --> 22:30.440
Just try and see if they fit.

22:54.620 --> 22:55.620
You're back!

22:56.660 --> 22:58.480
How long are you staying this time?

22:59.630 --> 23:01.210
I think I will

23:01.450 --> 23:02.280
settle down,

23:02.300 --> 23:04.020
so I can spend more time with my parents.

23:05.280 --> 23:07.230
That's nice.

23:07.250 --> 23:08.490
I'm glad you're back.

23:08.520 --> 23:09.760
I'll leave you to your work then.

23:09.780 --> 23:10.460
I should

23:10.480 --> 23:11.200
go home now.

23:14.010 --> 23:15.220
Sure.

23:39.210 --> 23:42.210
The old man entered the royal court to plead for mercy.

23:42.240 --> 23:43.930
Did he succeed?

23:43.960 --> 23:45.110
What happened

23:45.110 --> 23:47.110
will be revealed in the next episode.

23:54.720 --> 23:55.620
Grandpa,

23:55.650 --> 23:57.800
what do you think of today's show?

23:59.200 --> 23:59.960
It was good.

24:00.240 --> 24:00.980
Let's go.

24:03.000 --> 24:03.680
Be careful.

24:04.970 --> 24:05.770
Nice and slow.

24:08.230 --> 24:09.360
Mr. Zhou.

24:11.740 --> 24:12.940
Who are you?

24:13.200 --> 24:14.070
I am Mr. Xu,

24:14.090 --> 24:15.350
the owner of this place.

24:17.360 --> 24:19.160
The owner is Mr. Zhao.

24:23.130 --> 24:24.640
What's the matter? You can tell me.

24:24.670 --> 24:26.410
I have a favor to ask.

24:26.490 --> 24:27.010
Go ahead.

24:27.030 --> 24:29.160
Mr. Zhao has paid for an annual membership.

24:29.260 --> 24:30.410
There is some money left in the account.

24:30.980 --> 24:32.130
I need to return it.

24:32.960 --> 24:34.200
Why?

24:34.480 --> 24:35.720
This place is closing down.

24:36.220 --> 24:37.320
Nowadays,

24:38.230 --> 24:40.080
except for regular patrons like you,

24:40.640 --> 24:42.720
nobody enjoys storytelling performances anymore.

24:44.140 --> 24:45.400
Are you serious?

24:45.480 --> 24:46.720
Some young people

24:46.740 --> 24:48.230
were around just now, weren't they?

24:50.620 --> 24:52.410
They are the performers' families.

24:52.520 --> 24:54.110
Sometimes performers

24:54.160 --> 24:55.920
even outnumber the audience.

24:56.260 --> 24:57.620
How come?

24:58.570 --> 24:59.980
The other day when I was here,

25:00.010 --> 25:01.710
the audience was full.

25:02.200 --> 25:03.270
The show that day

25:03.750 --> 25:04.700
was the Legend of Yue Fei.

25:05.840 --> 25:07.090
The Legend of Yue Fei?

25:09.160 --> 25:11.830
I haven't heard that story for a while.

25:24.860 --> 25:26.220
Lots of stuff, right?

25:27.550 --> 25:29.510
Before I knew it, I already collected so many things.

25:32.100 --> 25:33.620
Good for you.

25:33.980 --> 25:35.870
This place looks like a small museum.

25:35.890 --> 25:37.160
Right?

25:37.910 --> 25:38.640
Many of these

25:38.640 --> 25:39.750
were collected by Grandpa

25:39.790 --> 25:41.270
during the research of

25:41.270 --> 25:42.310
the Flower Street and the canal.

25:42.830 --> 25:44.110
I've sorted out the information.

25:44.110 --> 25:44.980
Would you like to take it?

25:45.010 --> 25:45.730
No need.

25:45.760 --> 25:46.850
Just leave it here.

25:46.980 --> 25:48.310
I don't have a use for it anyway.

25:48.390 --> 25:49.300
Okay.

25:52.150 --> 25:52.910
Beautiful.

25:52.930 --> 25:53.590
Have some water.

25:53.780 --> 25:54.300
Sure.

25:56.570 --> 25:57.950
This is the result

25:58.030 --> 26:00.030
of the hard work done by us and Grandpa, right?

26:00.760 --> 26:02.340
It'll be a shame if these things just lay around here.

26:07.380 --> 26:08.360
Why don't you

26:08.380 --> 26:09.820
sort out

26:09.850 --> 26:11.210
these items,

26:11.270 --> 26:12.480
and exhibit them to the citizens?

26:13.680 --> 26:14.920
As I remember,

26:14.940 --> 26:16.430
after the canal was certified as World Heritage,

26:16.750 --> 26:18.720
the municipal government began extending aid and support

26:18.720 --> 26:19.980
to relevant traditional cultures.

26:20.110 --> 26:21.240
You should ask your mom about it.

26:23.070 --> 26:24.580
I'll do it in your stead if you can't.

26:24.600 --> 26:25.200
No need.

26:26.000 --> 26:27.230
L-Let me think about it.

26:28.820 --> 26:29.650
What about you?

26:30.360 --> 26:31.500
Will you settle down here?

26:34.170 --> 26:35.840
I want to spend more time with my grandpa.

26:37.410 --> 26:38.900
He needs someone to take care of him.

26:38.920 --> 26:39.540
Oh, right!

26:40.440 --> 26:41.860
You know what storytelling is, don't you?

26:42.250 --> 26:44.900
What if I set up a storytelling house?

26:44.920 --> 26:47.090
Are people still into storytelling shows nowadays?

26:47.120 --> 26:48.750
Where there is a will, there is a way.

26:49.130 --> 26:50.240
I just want to set up a storytelling house

26:50.260 --> 26:52.550
that even appeals to young people.

26:53.050 --> 26:55.530
The decoration will be stylish.

26:55.620 --> 26:57.160
I'll also build a fixed stage

26:57.160 --> 26:58.330
for storytelling shows.

26:58.440 --> 26:59.270
The elderly can spend their spare time

26:59.270 --> 27:00.640
drinking tea and listening to stories there,

27:00.660 --> 27:01.980
while young people

27:02.040 --> 27:04.100
can have coffee, read books or meet up with friends.

27:04.160 --> 27:05.830
Those who are passionate about history and culture like you

27:05.850 --> 27:06.480
can exchange ideas there.

27:06.510 --> 27:07.400
-Sounds nice.
-Activities like those.

27:07.420 --> 27:08.450
It seems like a good idea.

27:08.480 --> 27:09.760
That can also be

27:09.780 --> 27:10.590
where we auction

27:10.610 --> 27:11.890
or exhibit antiques.

27:11.920 --> 27:13.820
That's right. If there is such a place,

27:13.850 --> 27:14.600
would you like to go?

27:14.620 --> 27:15.750
Sure.

27:15.780 --> 27:18.080
I think that's the kind of place that is missing from the Flower Street.

27:18.100 --> 27:21.160
It's like hearing a grandpa tell stories. How nice.

27:21.190 --> 27:22.400
I just have this thought

27:23.330 --> 27:24.890
that some people enjoy quietness,

27:25.020 --> 27:28.110
and some others would like to take a rest somewhere.

27:28.590 --> 27:29.390
Actually,

27:30.330 --> 27:32.210
I'm in search of

27:32.300 --> 27:33.590
a lifestyle.

27:39.700 --> 27:42.440
[Urban Planning of Honghuai City]

27:50.440 --> 27:51.440
Rest assured, everyone.

27:51.480 --> 27:52.750
We will solve the problems

27:52.750 --> 27:54.670
we discussed today as soon as possible.

27:54.690 --> 27:57.700
Thank you, Mayor Gu. Thank you so much.

27:57.890 --> 27:58.970
Just go home and don't worry.

27:59.000 --> 27:59.960
Hui, walk them out.

27:59.980 --> 28:01.740
Goodbye.

28:03.300 --> 28:04.540
Fenghua!

28:05.150 --> 28:06.550
I'm sorry.

28:06.550 --> 28:07.590
The meeting ran late.

28:07.590 --> 28:09.060
Sorry to keep you waiting.

28:09.310 --> 28:10.000
No worries.

28:10.030 --> 28:11.000
Have a seat.

28:11.000 --> 28:12.110
You're being too courteous.

28:12.110 --> 28:13.270
That makes me feel nervous.

28:13.310 --> 28:14.590
What's to be nervous about?

28:15.250 --> 28:17.240
You’re Mayor Gu now.

28:18.960 --> 28:20.070
Don’t say that.

28:20.110 --> 28:21.200
I watched you

28:21.240 --> 28:22.750
grow up, remember?

28:23.750 --> 28:25.830
You used to call me Auntie Gu.

28:26.070 --> 28:26.880
Auntie Gu.

28:28.370 --> 28:28.960
Have some tea.

28:29.000 --> 28:29.790
Thank you, Auntie Gu.

28:39.920 --> 28:41.610
I remember when you were a child,

28:41.740 --> 28:43.930
you often played with the boys in the courtyard

28:43.960 --> 28:45.270
like a little monkey covered in mud.

28:46.050 --> 28:47.480
Look at you now.

28:47.600 --> 28:49.430
Girls really do change a lot as they grow up.

28:49.510 --> 28:50.880
You've become prettier.

28:51.300 --> 28:53.090
After all, I worked in Beijing for some time,

28:53.310 --> 28:55.550
and was exposed to many things.

28:55.590 --> 28:56.440
Right.

28:57.510 --> 28:58.790
Chen Rui told me

28:59.070 --> 29:00.720
that you and your friends are back, right?

29:03.510 --> 29:04.910
We got tired of working in Beijing,

29:05.070 --> 29:05.960
and we felt homesick.

29:07.330 --> 29:08.390
It's good that you're back.

29:08.650 --> 29:10.020
You should have come back earlier.

29:10.790 --> 29:12.030
Since the canal was accredited as World Heritage,

29:12.050 --> 29:13.040
the Flower Street

29:13.070 --> 29:15.270
has taken on a brand new look.

29:15.960 --> 29:17.200
Elites like you

29:17.240 --> 29:18.960
should return to their hometowns,

29:19.070 --> 29:20.590
and make contributions.

29:22.790 --> 29:24.160
I'm more of a dud

29:24.310 --> 29:25.620
than an elite.

29:25.790 --> 29:27.160
Don't say that, alright?

29:28.790 --> 29:29.550
Auntie Gu,

29:30.000 --> 29:31.400
I came here today

29:31.750 --> 29:33.550
to ask you the details

29:33.720 --> 29:35.720
about the renovation of the Flower Street.

29:36.480 --> 29:37.110
Okay.

29:38.110 --> 29:39.070
What would you like to know?

29:41.050 --> 29:43.490
Actually, I have a rough idea

29:43.550 --> 29:44.400
that I'd like to tell you.

29:45.180 --> 29:46.430
I'm wondering

29:46.460 --> 29:47.910
if it's possible to separate an area

29:47.930 --> 29:50.170
in the Flower Street for the residents

29:50.200 --> 29:51.380
to build their own houses.

29:51.620 --> 29:52.960
This way, they can

29:52.980 --> 29:54.580
be neighbors again.

29:54.850 --> 29:57.070
The plans have been decided.

29:57.200 --> 29:58.570
In principle, no change is allowed.

29:59.570 --> 30:01.810
My parents and those of their generation

30:01.830 --> 30:03.590
have lived in the Flower Street for most of their lives.

30:04.110 --> 30:05.640
As their children,

30:05.660 --> 30:07.820
we surely hope they can still be neighbors

30:07.840 --> 30:09.200
after they retire.

30:09.400 --> 30:10.350
As you know,

30:10.350 --> 30:12.150
the elderly don't like being alone.

30:12.180 --> 30:14.100
Their lives will be more pleasant

30:14.120 --> 30:15.910
if they are surrounded by old neighbors.

30:19.720 --> 30:21.440
How about this?

30:21.850 --> 30:22.900
You can

30:22.930 --> 30:24.450
discuss it with the residents,

30:24.890 --> 30:27.420
and try to reach an unanimous decision

30:27.680 --> 30:29.430
as to whether to build your own houses

30:29.460 --> 30:31.590
or to move to the places as the original proposal says.

30:32.200 --> 30:34.260
When you reach a consensus,

30:34.440 --> 30:35.750
we'll talk about it,

30:35.780 --> 30:36.740
and figure out a way together.

30:37.590 --> 30:39.320
Okay, no problem.

30:39.340 --> 30:41.120
I believe if the conditions allow,

30:41.140 --> 30:43.140
they will definitely choose to live near one another.

30:43.170 --> 30:44.110
Thank you, Auntie Gu.

30:44.320 --> 30:45.320
Anytime.

30:47.110 --> 30:48.200
Look at this.

30:48.200 --> 30:49.480
Xingchi, have a seat.

30:49.480 --> 30:50.610
These are the floor plans, right?

30:50.790 --> 30:51.880
Get ready for the meeting.

30:53.000 --> 30:54.110
What is this?

30:54.110 --> 30:55.730
Ladies and gentlemen,

30:55.790 --> 30:57.360
we're here today

30:57.390 --> 30:58.460
to discuss

30:58.480 --> 30:59.720
a matter.

31:00.020 --> 31:01.960
Okay. Sure.

31:01.990 --> 31:02.880
Sit down.

31:02.900 --> 31:04.170
Be seated. It's cozier this way.

31:05.890 --> 31:07.120
As you all know,

31:07.140 --> 31:08.620
the Flower Street is about to be renovated.

31:08.940 --> 31:10.320
It's a good thing.

31:10.540 --> 31:12.170
But after the renovation,

31:12.350 --> 31:13.640
we'll have to live apart from one another.

31:14.090 --> 31:15.170
We spent

31:15.200 --> 31:17.290
all these years being friends and neighbors.

31:17.360 --> 31:18.750
I believe you all want to stick together.

31:18.750 --> 31:20.210
-Yes.
-That's for sure.

31:20.240 --> 31:21.590
We definitely don't want to be apart.

31:21.610 --> 31:22.410
Therefore,

31:22.500 --> 31:23.600
Wanghe and I

31:23.630 --> 31:25.610
found a courtyard for you.

31:26.100 --> 31:27.700
Though it is a bit old,

31:27.720 --> 31:29.100
it is very spacious.

31:29.430 --> 31:30.310
We can remodel it.

31:30.790 --> 31:31.950
I think we can

31:31.970 --> 31:33.970
share the cost together.

31:34.950 --> 31:36.020
As for the government-assigned apartments,

31:36.040 --> 31:37.210
we'll leave them to Siyi.

31:37.530 --> 31:38.720
When we finish remodeling the courtyard,

31:38.790 --> 31:39.870
we can all move in,

31:39.890 --> 31:40.850
and be neighbors again.

31:41.330 --> 31:42.400
That's great!

31:42.400 --> 31:43.680
It's great news!

31:43.720 --> 31:44.830
Raise your hand if you agree to the plan.

31:44.830 --> 31:45.880
I'm raising both my hands!

31:47.960 --> 31:48.790
Well,

31:48.790 --> 31:51.070
I've seen the floor plans of the apartment buildings

31:51.070 --> 31:52.310
assigned by the government.

31:52.700 --> 31:53.700
The apartments look fine,

31:53.720 --> 31:54.960
and they are in a good location.

31:55.080 --> 31:56.510
More importantly, the environment there

31:56.550 --> 31:57.290
is also quite nice.

31:57.320 --> 31:58.070
Dad!

31:59.030 --> 32:00.160
This is a big decision.

32:00.160 --> 32:02.110
Shouldn't you let them mull it over?

32:02.130 --> 32:03.760
-Mr. Shao...
-X-Xingchi!

32:04.110 --> 32:04.640
Hurry!

32:04.670 --> 32:05.240
Dad,

32:05.310 --> 32:05.960
raise your hand!

32:07.530 --> 32:08.900
Okay, you all approve of it.

32:08.930 --> 32:10.440
We'll be neighbors again.

32:11.420 --> 32:12.570
Well,

32:12.750 --> 32:14.130
I'll pay the cost

32:14.150 --> 32:15.000
of the common areas.

32:15.550 --> 32:18.120
You only need to pay for your own living places.

32:18.350 --> 32:19.080
Besides,

32:19.110 --> 32:20.190
Fenghua and I

32:20.220 --> 32:22.660
will find the best designers

32:22.680 --> 32:23.610
to offer us solutions.

32:23.770 --> 32:24.840
Your satisfaction is guaranteed, alright?

32:24.860 --> 32:25.860
Great!

32:25.890 --> 32:26.890
Come on.

32:26.910 --> 32:28.840
To us sticking together.

32:28.860 --> 32:30.070
Sure!

32:30.100 --> 32:31.580
Sticking together!

32:31.600 --> 32:32.590
Sticking together!

32:53.190 --> 32:55.020
I didn't expect things would go so fast between you two.

32:57.910 --> 32:58.850
Yeah.

32:58.870 --> 33:00.760
I want to get married when I'm still young.

33:00.790 --> 33:01.840
A wrinkled face

33:01.960 --> 33:03.440
won't look good in wedding photos.

33:04.660 --> 33:06.010
It's high time you found a wife.

33:06.040 --> 33:07.170
If there is a girl you like...

33:07.190 --> 33:07.950
There is.

33:14.570 --> 33:15.730
Don't worry.

33:16.090 --> 33:17.130
I'm handsome,

33:17.160 --> 33:18.570
and I have a good master.

33:18.590 --> 33:19.680
I'm sure I'll become the best chef

33:19.680 --> 33:21.170
of Huaiyang cuisine in the Flower Street.

33:21.200 --> 33:22.680
I can easily find a wife, don't you think?

33:24.930 --> 33:25.570
You're right.

33:26.440 --> 33:28.210
Men who can cook are quite popular

33:28.230 --> 33:29.190
among girls now.

33:33.350 --> 33:34.000
I hope

33:37.020 --> 33:37.780
you'll be well.

33:38.930 --> 33:40.670
You should fix your illness after getting married,

33:40.750 --> 33:41.960
and lead a happy life.

33:43.780 --> 33:45.510
If Wanghe doesn't treat you right,

33:45.510 --> 33:46.270
tell me immediately.

33:46.550 --> 33:48.680
I'll bring my household register with me and take you away.

33:49.880 --> 33:50.970
I'm sorry.

33:51.510 --> 33:52.360
I'm sorry.

33:52.630 --> 33:53.960
What are you laughing at?

33:54.000 --> 33:55.240
Nothing. It's just...

33:56.060 --> 33:57.560
When you said you would take me away,

33:57.790 --> 33:59.440
I could see a picture in my head.

33:59.460 --> 34:01.700
I imagined that Wanghe and you would grab each other's hair.

34:03.130 --> 34:04.150
"Let go!"

34:04.260 --> 34:05.200
"You let go first!"

34:05.220 --> 34:06.100
"Will you let go or not?"

34:06.200 --> 34:07.110
"I'm gonna yell for help!"

34:07.510 --> 34:08.310
Then,

34:08.590 --> 34:11.239
I would be taking photos of you two,

34:11.270 --> 34:13.650
not giving a hoot about who would live or die.

34:14.480 --> 34:16.190
It would be so fun.

34:35.810 --> 34:36.699
Xingchi.

34:40.400 --> 34:42.710
I hope you can be as happy as I am.

34:44.800 --> 34:46.800
I wish you will find

34:47.080 --> 34:48.170
a nice woman

34:49.159 --> 34:50.139
who appreciates you,

34:51.020 --> 34:51.870
loves you,

34:53.080 --> 34:55.420
cares about you and even dotes on you as if you were a kid.

34:58.860 --> 34:59.670
Thank you.

35:02.760 --> 35:03.670
I hope

35:05.120 --> 35:06.590
you and Wanghe

35:07.740 --> 35:08.990
will grow old together,

35:11.260 --> 35:12.220
and have a lifetime of happiness.

35:20.840 --> 35:21.550
Grandpa,

35:21.570 --> 35:22.320
the Flower Street

35:22.320 --> 35:23.480
will be renovated soon.

35:23.480 --> 35:24.280
Before long,

35:24.280 --> 35:25.030
we will all move out.

35:25.870 --> 35:27.070
Really?

35:29.270 --> 35:31.230
Then where will we live?

35:31.670 --> 35:33.460
Fenghua found a courtyard for us.

35:33.760 --> 35:34.710
We'll move there.

35:34.730 --> 35:35.600
Is everybody moving there?

35:35.630 --> 35:36.400
Yes.

35:38.530 --> 35:39.410
Our family...

35:40.220 --> 35:41.090
The Xie family...

35:42.350 --> 35:43.320
The Xia family...

35:44.510 --> 35:45.400
The Shao family...

35:46.110 --> 35:47.760
Grandpa, don't worry.

35:47.780 --> 35:48.300
Everybody here

35:48.330 --> 35:50.140
will move to the new courtyard.

35:50.360 --> 35:51.230
When we move,

35:51.230 --> 35:52.880
I'll catch all the crickets here and bring them to you.

35:54.490 --> 35:55.290
That's good.

35:57.150 --> 35:58.920
Is there a central hall?

35:58.940 --> 35:59.750
Yes.

36:00.930 --> 36:02.110
Don't worry.

36:02.590 --> 36:04.800
That courtyard is much bigger than this one.

36:05.400 --> 36:06.040
Good.

36:07.230 --> 36:08.670
The central hall should be saved for Granny Ma.

36:09.710 --> 36:10.780
Plus,

36:11.160 --> 36:13.470
we should install an air conditioner for her.

36:13.640 --> 36:14.660
Her room is too warm.

36:15.360 --> 36:16.510
In summer days,

36:16.510 --> 36:17.840
the heat would push everyone away.

36:18.620 --> 36:20.070
Get her

36:21.000 --> 36:22.270
a new TV too.

36:22.580 --> 36:23.660
It

36:24.510 --> 36:26.660
has to be 40 inches, with an LCD screen.

36:27.570 --> 36:30.190
The radio says there are promotional activities lately.

36:30.970 --> 36:32.120
Electric appliances are on sale.

36:33.350 --> 36:35.600
Buy her a TV when you have time.

36:35.810 --> 36:36.440
Okay.

36:37.120 --> 36:38.580
It's best

36:39.190 --> 36:41.000
if you get her a new washing machine as well.

36:41.670 --> 36:43.590
Granny Ma always tries to save on her electric bills,

36:43.670 --> 36:45.070
so she often washes her clothes by hand.

36:45.710 --> 36:47.300
Why bother?

36:47.320 --> 36:49.360
Power prices aren't that high, are they?

37:02.120 --> 37:03.840
When are you and Fenghua leaving?

37:04.970 --> 37:05.740
Tomorrow.

37:06.490 --> 37:08.550
Then you'll miss the opening of my bookstore.

37:08.830 --> 37:10.020
We will come back someday.

37:11.230 --> 37:12.740
Wish you prosperity!

37:14.130 --> 37:15.320
I don't think it'll come true for me.

37:15.340 --> 37:16.690
I'll take it as a win if I don't lose any money.

37:22.740 --> 37:23.920
What transportation will you take tomorrow?

37:24.550 --> 37:25.400
I'll drive a car.

37:26.230 --> 37:27.070
Fenghua said

37:28.510 --> 37:30.760
she would love to go north along the canal,

37:31.130 --> 37:32.560
so she could see the scenery on the road.

37:33.400 --> 37:35.160
Is she physically strong enough for that?

37:35.670 --> 37:36.550
First, we'll leave the province,

37:36.710 --> 37:38.090
get on the highway,

37:38.840 --> 37:40.170
and then drive along the canal.

37:41.590 --> 37:43.310
It'll take about one week.

37:43.890 --> 37:45.000
I think she'll be fine.

37:45.070 --> 37:46.000
One week?

37:47.220 --> 37:48.490
As I remember,

37:48.770 --> 37:50.590
it would take at least one month

37:50.870 --> 37:52.730
to go to the north by ship。

37:52.750 --> 37:54.080
The main cities and towns

37:54.710 --> 37:56.270
we'll come across

37:57.230 --> 38:00.110
are Xuzhou, Jining, Linqing,

38:00.110 --> 38:01.960
Cangzhou and Tianjin.

38:02.330 --> 38:03.520
Fenghua said,

38:04.420 --> 38:06.660
since we grew up by the canal,

38:07.230 --> 38:08.490
whenever she felt tired

38:08.690 --> 38:09.730
in Beijing,

38:10.030 --> 38:11.920
she would take a walk by the river to recharge her batteries.

38:12.820 --> 38:13.770
This time,

38:14.750 --> 38:16.090
she plans to recharge her batteries on the whole trip,

38:16.560 --> 38:18.610
till she is fully energized and ready to receive surgery.

38:21.630 --> 38:22.150
Okay.

38:23.010 --> 38:24.090
I wish you

38:24.880 --> 38:25.810
all the best.

38:26.580 --> 38:27.700
And I hope

38:29.000 --> 38:29.800
you will come home soon.

38:31.480 --> 38:32.510
Thank you.

38:44.920 --> 38:46.690
I'll keep you updated. Don't worry.

38:46.720 --> 38:47.920
Just take good care

38:47.940 --> 38:50.350
-of your family.
-Hurry up.

38:51.390 --> 38:52.090
There you go.

38:52.330 --> 38:53.070
Alright.

38:53.070 --> 38:54.400
Go take care of your daughter.

38:54.480 --> 38:56.220
I-I'm leaving then.

38:56.480 --> 38:57.260
I'll be off then, Dad.

38:57.360 --> 38:57.960
Okay.

38:57.960 --> 38:58.740
Easy on the drinks.

38:58.840 --> 38:59.550
Okay.

38:59.590 --> 39:01.300
I'll be waiting for you to come back.

39:01.400 --> 39:02.730
Go home. Go home now.

39:02.760 --> 39:03.320
Bye.

39:05.510 --> 39:06.230
We're leaving then.

39:06.230 --> 39:06.920
Okay.

39:06.920 --> 39:08.510
Off you go.

39:08.510 --> 39:09.230
Don't worry.

39:17.000 --> 39:20.280
♫There are lights afar♫

39:21.810 --> 39:24.950
♫You lower your head as you walk♫

39:27.080 --> 39:29.950
♫The bigger the city is, the more unsettled one feels♫

39:30.580 --> 39:33.760
♫So many yearnings, on a long road♫

39:36.860 --> 39:39.850
♫Too many heart-breaking moments along the way♫

39:41.370 --> 39:44.450
♫The smiles in the past are forgotten♫

39:46.420 --> 39:48.150
♫Time makes us♫

39:48.320 --> 39:49.010
Right here.

39:48.700 --> 39:50.190
♫Fragile and tough♫

39:49.030 --> 39:49.840
Here?

39:50.350 --> 39:51.320
Looks big.

39:50.540 --> 39:54.540
♫I want to sing to you again, gently♫

39:52.060 --> 39:53.570
Aren't you rich, Brother Kuo?

39:54.590 --> 39:55.670
Don't you know this place? Look over there.

39:55.330 --> 39:59.260
♫How I wish I can be with you♫

39:55.670 --> 39:56.810
There is a river over there.

39:59.480 --> 40:00.230
Nice.

39:59.940 --> 40:03.810
♫I want to tell you the scenery I've seen♫

40:00.230 --> 40:01.480
The surroundings look fine to me.

40:01.480 --> 40:02.700
What a lovely place.

40:02.730 --> 40:03.700
And it's much bigger.

40:03.880 --> 40:04.550
Let's go inside.

40:04.570 --> 40:05.220
Sure.

40:04.720 --> 40:08.760
♫I think on every silent night♫

40:10.020 --> 40:13.990
♫About you and everything between us♫

40:14.990 --> 40:18.900
♫I want to be the light of your life♫

40:19.500 --> 40:23.450
♫I want to bring sunshine to your life♫

40:23.060 --> 40:25.020
After evaluation, our professional opinion

40:24.830 --> 40:28.620
♫I want to be with you for all the ups and downs♫

40:25.040 --> 40:26.690
is that given your current condition,

40:26.720 --> 40:28.030
the success rate

40:28.070 --> 40:29.610
of a craniotomy is high,

40:29.630 --> 40:31.690
and your illness is very likely to be cured.

40:32.230 --> 40:32.940
Don't worry.

40:32.960 --> 40:35.170
We'll try to minimize the risk.

40:35.200 --> 40:35.950
So,

40:36.030 --> 40:37.590
I hope you'll stay positive and receive treatment.

40:50.300 --> 40:51.150
What are you doing?

40:51.890 --> 40:52.740
Get back to your work.

40:52.930 --> 40:53.540
Master.

41:15.380 --> 41:17.820
♫Too many heart-breaking moments along the way♫

41:19.450 --> 41:22.530
♫The smiles in the past are forgotten♫

41:20.620 --> 41:21.480
What is it?

41:21.480 --> 41:23.190
Isn't this a photo of my grandpa?

41:24.200 --> 41:25.980
♫Time makes us♫

41:25.010 --> 41:26.050
Looks sharp.

41:26.630 --> 41:28.080
♫Fragile and tough♫

41:28.620 --> 41:32.330
♫I want to sing to you again, gently♫

41:29.400 --> 41:30.650
So handsome.

41:30.700 --> 41:32.540
Keep an accurate account

41:32.880 --> 41:34.140
of the numbers.

41:33.410 --> 41:37.340
♫How I wish I can be with you♫

41:37.820 --> 41:38.550
Thank you.

41:38.020 --> 41:41.890
♫I want to tell you the scenery I've seen♫

41:42.800 --> 41:46.580
♫I think on every silent night♫

41:48.100 --> 41:52.070
♫About you and everything between us♫

41:48.920 --> 41:49.710
Hello?

41:49.730 --> 41:50.510
Hi.

41:50.540 --> 41:52.320
Is this a bookstore?

41:52.340 --> 41:53.200
Yes.

41:53.070 --> 41:56.980
♫I want to be the light of your life♫

41:57.580 --> 42:01.530
♫I want to bring sunshine to your life♫

42:00.550 --> 42:02.190
We're not open for business yet.

42:02.910 --> 42:06.700
♫I want to be with you for all the ups and downs♫

42:03.690 --> 42:04.590
Okay.

42:04.720 --> 42:05.860
We'll open on the day after tomorrow,

42:06.180 --> 42:07.290
at 9:30 a.m.

42:07.310 --> 42:08.320
There will be discounts.

42:07.800 --> 42:11.320
♫I want to grow with you♫

42:10.160 --> 42:10.750
Got it.

42:10.770 --> 42:11.980
I'll be here.

42:12.380 --> 42:13.080
Okay.

42:13.200 --> 42:16.540
♫How I wish I can be with you♫

42:13.320 --> 42:13.830
Bye bye.

42:13.980 --> 42:14.690
Bye bye.

42:17.130 --> 42:21.080
♫I want to tell you the scenery I've seen♫

42:22.030 --> 42:25.940
♫I think on every silent night♫

42:27.720 --> 42:31.190
♫About you and everything between us♫

42:32.120 --> 42:35.980
♫I want to be the light of your life♫

42:36.580 --> 42:40.710
♫I want to bring sunshine to your life♫

42:42.150 --> 42:45.850
♫I want to be with you for all the ups and downs♫

42:44.050 --> 42:45.040
Fenghua,

42:45.180 --> 42:46.100
don't be afraid.

42:46.310 --> 42:47.640
Mom is here.

42:46.870 --> 42:50.320
♫I want to grow with you♫

42:49.030 --> 42:49.780
My little girl.
